  "description": "Most recipes for melitzanosalata, a Greek roasted eggplant dip, have you roast the eggplant in the oven for 30 minutes until it's completely soft. After grilling the eggplant instead and avoiding that oven heat, I'd argue it's grill or nothing for this dip. It has a nice cooling effect, with creamy smokiness balanced by the fresh lemon and parsley.",
